#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:9
msgid ""
"Just the basics on this page: what you're mapping, where, and which app "
"mappers will use.\n"
"    You'll pick your survey questions and map data on the next page."
msgstr ""
"Awọn ipilẹ nikan ni oju-iwe yii: ohun ti o n ṣe maapu, ibiti, ati app ti "
"awọn alamaapu yoo lo. Iwọ yoo yan awọn ibeere ìwádìí ati data maapu ni "
"oju-iwe atẹle."

