msgid "Which app will mappers use?"
msgstr "App wo ni awọn alamaapu yoo lo?"

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:69
msgid "Pick the app you want mappers to install on their phone to do the survey."
msgstr "Yan app ti o fẹ ki awọn alamaapu fi sori foonu wọn lati ṣe ìwádìí naa."

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:89
msgid ""
"Powerful GIS-style mapping app, including geometry editing, but with a "
"simple\n"
"                mapping pathway enabled via our HOT plugin."
msgstr ""
"App ṣiṣe maapu ara GIS to lagbara, pẹlu atunṣe geometry, ṣugbọn pẹlu ọna "
"ṣiṣe maapu ti o rọrun nipasẹ plugin HOT wa."

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:111
msgid ""
"Simple form-based survey app. Best for straightforward question-and-"
"answer\n"
"                surveys."
msgstr ""
"App ìwádìí ti o rọrun ti o da lori fọọmu. O dara julọ fun ìwádìí ibeere-"
"ati-idahun taara."

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:120
msgid "Where are you mapping?"
msgstr "Ti ṣetan fún ṣíṣe maapu"

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:122
msgid "Draw the area mappers will cover. Smaller areas are easier to coordinate."
msgstr "Fa agbegbe ti awọn alamaapu yoo bo. Awọn agbegbe kekere rọrun lati ṣakoso."

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:129
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Àwọn hashtag"

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:131
msgid "optional"
msgstr "aṣayan"

